These are the files for Life with David, Bare Metal Adventures, Chapter 16, Multi-core, multi-program, multi-memory execution.  
This includes the source, CMakeLists, and linker script files for Demo 4:

Demo 4) Starting Core 1 and transferring into an endless loop inside the C program.  Meanwhile, Core 0 copies the assembly program 
        from FLASH to SRAM, copies a 64 kB dtat file from FLASH to SRAM, and then transfers execution from the C program in FLASH 
        to the assembly program in SRAM.

